 2272                   ;NEXT WE ACTIVATE THE S100 TMA 0,1 2, or 3  LINES USING THE SMB 
 2273                   ;(SWITCHES CONTROL OVER TO THE 8088, 8086 or 80286....68K etc) 
 2274                   ;Inputting (any) data from Port SW_DMA0 lowers the S-100 TMA0* PIN #55 line on the old V1 SMB.
 2275                   ;THIS WILL CAUSE THE 8086/80286 BOARD TO BECOME ACTIVE AND TAKE OVER THE BUS. 
 2276                   ;THE Z80 WILL BE IN A PERMANANT HOLD STATE UNTIL THE S100 PIN #55 IS AGAIN RAISED.
 2277                   
